{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S05、S10等段仍有较多感受词同时出现，个别意象如“银色蛛丝”“旧房子”也稍显跳跃，直接性不如Y。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"平\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的亮字能让观众迅速抓住人物每一阶段的关键念头、顾虑和选择，不必逐字读完就能跟上故事；感受词按音乐进程出现，也让情绪变化有了时间和声音上的对应。Y的完整叙述在解释人物心理方面同样清楚，甚至个别地方更自然，但右侧短词容易形成同时堆积的感受清单；X虽然偶有意象跳跃和局部过密，整体仍更容易让观众边听边看，既抓住人物关系的变化，也感受到情绪内部细微的起伏。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "270c7089-e93e-4b46-acff-b053c3a7d9e9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T010123186933Z", "elapsed_seconds": 115.14, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:03:18.340415+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6fd2eb2df6e2351e2c7e8ac66e2b3a8a99c5c3e9a46bf60759977881791d48e2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_att